==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Minccino|88}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*'''Tail Smack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Snivy|6}}, one of the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
